<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>补泻大法 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%A1%A5%E6%B3%BB%E5%A4%A7%E6%B3%95/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.157.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.3</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 10:14:22 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%A1%A5%E6%B3%BB%E5%A4%A7%E6%B3%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>九针十二原第一：法天</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-01/</link><pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 10:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/lingshu-01/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%81%B5%E6%9E%A2/">灵枢</category><description>九针，是指古代针刺治疗所用的九种不同形状的针具；十二原，是指脏腑真气输注于体表的处所，也是治疗脏腑疾患的十二个要穴。本篇详细明确地介绍了九针的名称、形状以及不同的用途；介绍了十二原穴的名称及其各自所对应的脏腑，并说明了五脏六腑有病，可以分别取用相应的十二原穴来进行治疗的道理。所以本篇名为&amp;quot;九针十二原&amp;quot;。</description></item></channel></rss>